      "type": "text",
      "title": "Useful Explore Queries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 52,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Useful Explore Queries\n\n**Logs**\n```logql\n{service_name=\"$service\"}\n```\n\n**Traces**\n```traceql\n{ service.name = \"$service\" }\n```\n\n**Agent-turn-like traces**\n```traceql\n{ service.name = \"$service\" && (name = \"turn/start\" || name = \"handle_responses\" || name = \"model_client.stream_responses_websocket\" || name = \"exec_command\") }\n```\n\n**Metrics from traces**\n```promql\nsum by (span_name) (traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=\"$service\"})\n```"
      }
